Sentinel: special value placed at end of array to simplify boundary\nchecks", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 249.94322204589844, 410.52960205078125, 260.3832092285156], [117.64799499511719, 260.8873291015625, 449.2115783691406, 271.3273010253906], [117.64799499511719, 271.8314208984375, 476.8415832519531, 282.2713928222656], [117.64799499511719, 282.7752685546875, 217.11959838867188, 293.2152404785156], [117.64799499511719, 293.7193603515625, 498.9455871582031, 304.1593322753906], [117.64799499511719, 304.6632080078125, 217.11959838867188, 315.1031799316406], [117.64799499511719, 315.6072998046875, 432.6335754394531, 326.0472717285156], [117.64799499511719, 326.5513916015625, 283.43157958984375, 336.9913635253906], [117.64799499511719, 337.4952392578125, 493.4195861816406, 347.9352111816406], [117.64799499511719, 348.4393310546875, 195.01559448242188, 358.8793029785156], [117.64799499511719, 359.3834228515625, 487.8935852050781, 369.8233947753906], [117.64799499511719, 370.3272705078125, 150.80760192871094, 380.7672424316406]], "duration": 42.825, "start_time": 38.75, "end_time": 81.575}, {"index": 6, "text": "RAM Model Details", "rects": [[94.60800170898438, 393.3673095703125, 188.5535888671875, 403.8072814941406]], "duration": 1.925, "start_time": 81.575, "end_time": 83.5}, {"index": 7, "text": "Instructions: arithmetic (+, \u2212, *, /, mod), data movement (LOAD,\nSTORE), control (branch, subroutine call)\nCost model: each simple instruction = 1 time unit; each memory access\n= 1 time unit\nWord size: fixed word length (e.g., c\u00b7lg n bits for input size n)\nNo fancy operations: no exponentiation or arbitrary-precision\narithmetic in unit time\nNo parallelism: instructions execute one after another sequentially\nNo hierarchy: ignores cache, virtual memory, disk (RAM is flat)\nPurpose: provides clean framework for asymptotic analysis; real\nmachines deviate but analysis transfers", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 416.4073486328125, 471.3155822753906, 426.8473205566406], [117.64799499511719, 427.3511962890625, 344.21759033203125, 437.7911682128906], [117.64799499511719, 438.2952880859375, 498.9455871582031, 448.7352600097656], [117.64799499511719, 449.2393798828125, 189.48959350585938, 459.6793518066406], [117.64799499511719, 460.1832275390625, 476.8415832519531, 470.6231994628906], [117.64799499511719, 471.1273193359375, 454.7375793457031, 481.5672912597656], [117.64799499511719, 482.0714111328125, 244.7495880126953, 492.5113830566406], [117.64799499511719, 493.0152587890625, 487.8935852050781, 503.4552307128906], [117.64799499511719, 503.9593505859375, 465.7895812988281, 514.3993530273438], [117.64799499511719, 514.9031982421875, 465.7895812988281, 525.3432006835938], [117.64799499511719, 525.8472900390625, 333.16558837890625, 536.2872924804688]], "duration": 48.025, "start_time": 83.5, "end_time": 131.525}, {"index": 8, "text": "Processes / Algorithms / Pathways", "rects": [[94.60800170898438, 549.4632568359375, 276.9696044921875, 559.9032592773438]], "duration": 3.125, "start_time": 131.525, "end_time": 134.65}, {"index": 9, "text": "INSERTION-SORT(A, n)", "rects": [[94.60800170898438, 572.789794921875, 184.42979431152344, 581.2722778320312], [117.64799499511719, 614.261962890625, 207.46978759765625, 622.7444458007812]], "duration": 2.2, "start_time": 134.65, "end_time": 136.85}, {"index": 10, "text": "Steps:", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 594.3912353515625, 150.80760192871094, 604.8312377929688]], "duration": 1.375, "start_time": 136.85, "end_time": 138.225}, {"index": 11, "text": "INSERTION-SORT(A, n)\nfor i = 2 to n:\n    key = A[i]\n    // Insert A[i] into sorted subarray A[1:i-1]\n    j = i - 1\n    while j > 0 and A[j] > key:\n        A[j+1] = A[j]\n        j = j - 1\n    A[j+1] = key", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 614.261962890625, 207.46978759765625, 622.7444458007812], [117.64799499511719, 622.90185546875, 185.01480102539062, 631.3843383789062], [117.64799499511719, 631.5419921875, 180.5238037109375, 640.0244750976562], [117.64799499511719, 640.181884765625, 333.2177734375, 648.6643676757812], [117.64799499511719, 648.82177734375, 176.0327911376953, 657.3042602539062], [117.64799499511719, 657.4619140625, 256.87078857421875, 665.9443969726562], [117.64799499511719, 666.101806640625, 211.96078491210938, 674.5842895507812], [117.64799499511719, 674.741943359375, 193.99679565429688, 683.2244262695312], [117.64799499511719, 683.3818359375, 189.50579833984375, 691.8643188476562]], "duration": 21.075, "start_time": 138.225, "end_time": 159.29999999999998}, {"index": 12, "text": "Loop invariant: At start of each iteration i, A[1:i-1] is sorted and\ncontains original elements A[1:i-1]", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 701.5272216796875, 493.4195861816406, 711.9672241210938], [117.64799499511719, 712.4713134765625, 311.06158447265625, 722.9113159179688]], "duration": 8.7, "start_time": 159.29999999999998, "end_time": 167.99999999999997}, {"index": 13, "text": "Correctness proof:", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 732.6312255859375, 217.11959838867188, 743.0712280273438]], "duration": 1.8, "start_time": 167.99999999999997, "end_time": 169.79999999999998}], "total_segments": 14, "status": "ready", "audio_url": "/static/sessions/9627eb5d/pages/3/page_audio.mp3", "total_duration": 169.79999999999998}